  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Interparty Dialogue, Capacity Building and Electoral Preparedness for Peaceful Elections in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims for more peaceful, inclusive elections in 2026 to contribute to democratic stability, interparty trust, and long-term democratic governance in Ethiopia.  This will be achieved by fostering trust, inclusivity, and cooperation among parties, reducing fragmentation and mitigating tensions that could otherwise undermine electoral stability. By strengthening party capacities, facilitating interparty dialogue, and supporting coordinated engagement with the National Election Board of Ethiopia (NEBE), the project will contribute to conflict-sensitive and inclusive electioneering, thereby promoting more peaceful competition in the 2026 elections and beyond.</narrative>
  </description>
